2. Baseline checkpoints — this repository's own output
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The eight fixed baseline checkpoints (LeWM and PLDM, across TwoRoom, PushT,
Reacher and Cube) were TRAINED IN THIS REPOSITORY from the datasets in
section 1, following LeWM's baseline recipe for 10 epochs, evaluated at the
end-of-training weights. No fine-tuning, continued training, or score-based
checkpoint selection was performed.

They are NOT LeWM's published pretrained weights, and must not be described
as such. An earlier version of this repository's documentation made that
claim; it was incorrect and was withdrawn. The correction and its evidence
are recorded in
`configs/benchmark/contextworld_icl_suite_v2_baseline_provenance_correction_v1.yaml`.

One upstream pretrained checkpoint was downloaded during development
(`quentinll/lewm-reacher/ckpt_hf/weights.pt`). It is not among the baselines,
is referenced by no preregistration or scoreboard row, and contributes to no
published number. It is not redistributed here.


