4. Environments
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The nine capability tasks are constructed on four environments — TwoRoom,
PushT, Reacher and Cube — reached through Stable-WorldModel. PushT, the
DeepMind Control Reacher task and the OGBench Cube task originate with their
respective upstream projects and remain under their own licenses. ContextWorld
contributes the hidden-dynamics factor variation, the paired context/query
construction, and the evaluation protocol layered on top of them; those
contributions are the material covered by DATA_LICENSE.


